      "text": "RAW FIBER                PREPARATION            SPINNING\n  +----------+             +----------+           +--------+\n  | Wool     |  scouring   | Clean,   |  carding/ | Yarn   |\n  | (animal) | ----------> | de-fat   | -combing->| thread |\n  | Flax     |  retting    | fiber    |           | singles|\n  | (plant)  | ----------> | bundles  |           | plied  |\n  | Cotton   |  ginning    |          |           |        |\n  | Silk     |  degumming  |          |           |        |\n  +----------+             +----------+           +--------+\n                                                       |\n       -------------------------------------------------+\n                                                        |\n                                                        v\n  DYEING                                    WEAVING\n  +-----------+         +-----------+      +---------+\n  | Mordant   |  color  | Dye bath  |      | Loom    |\n  | (alum,    | ------> | plant/    | ---> | warp +  |\n  | iron,     |  fixes  | insect/   |      | weft =  |\n  | copper)   |  dye    | mineral   |      | cloth   |\n  +-----------+         +-----------+      +---------+\n```"
